      "text" : "ui/legal-entities.screen.js",
      "styles" : {
        "code" : true
      }
    }, {
      "type" : "text",
      "text" : " region for region: a filter bar (name, lei, status), a dense table (name, lei, status; open, delete), and a side panel showing the default form (save, cancel). Retired rows are visibly marked. It is registered under "
    }, {
      "type" : "text",
      "text" : "Reference data › Legal entities",
